# Generated by scripts/optimize-images.mjs on every build (~22 MB of resized
# AVIF/WebP/JPEG variants). Derived entirely from public/images/, so it is a
# build artifact rather than a source: committing it would put a large binary
# blob in every diff that touches a photograph.
